docs/sol/sol_prompt.txt:28:A table of what each agent may do. Safe: read code, write in own worktree, run tests, open a PR. Denied by default: touch production, delete data, deploy, merge to main, force push, read secrets, send external requests, spend money. Anything irreversible needs a single-use approval naming the exact action, with what was READ BACK ALOUD to Neill, and a recovery plan.
