docs/sol/sol_round3.out:773:The existing system confirms that the document is describing a replacement, not today’s protection. Today, the general harness can write reviews and evidence, mark work shipped, launch model runners directly, and mint voice access from a provider key. The current voice path also uses model-based end-of-speech detection and allows paraphrasing. Those old routes are not merely unfinished; during the rebuild they must be removed or made impossible to run, or they become bypasses around the new design.
