docs/sol/sol_round1.out:191:| **The gatekeeper / release service itself** | It is the one thing that *must* act. | It is the smallest, most-reviewed component, runs as a separate trusted user, authenticates its callers, and re-verifies every request against records only it can write (§4). It is the single trusted computing base — kept tiny on purpose. |
