docs/sol/sol_out_v2.txt:4157:Then build an attack test for every agent type and every OpenClaw upgrade. The test should deliberately try to bypass the job record, forge evidence, change the protected version, spend beyond the limit, reach production, alter the rulebook, and reuse an approval. If any runner can do one of those things, that runner remains disabled until the route is closed.
