./docs/sol/sol_task10_gauntlet.out:3013:8. Correct. `run_gauntlet()` has no caller. The live local route explicitly requests one reviewer and fixes `required_reviews=1` ([server.py:372](/Users/user/code-projects/chief-command/harness/server.py:372)). `run_job()` invokes `_run_one_review()` directly ([executor.py:210](/Users/user/code-projects/chief-command/harness/executor.py:210)), and a single pass attempts `done` ([executor.py:251](/Users/user/code-projects/chief-command/harness/executor.py:251)). The integration point must replace that step after the build is versioned and parked for review. Leaving both paths alive leaves a bypass.
./docs/sol/sol_task10_gauntlet.out:3086:8. Correct. `run_gauntlet()` has no caller. The live local route explicitly requests one reviewer and fixes `required_reviews=1` ([server.py:372](/Users/user/code-projects/chief-command/harness/server.py:372)). `run_job()` invokes `_run_one_review()` directly ([executor.py:210](/Users/user/code-projects/chief-command/harness/executor.py:210)), and a single pass attempts `done` ([executor.py:251](/Users/user/code-projects/chief-command/harness/executor.py:251)). The integration point must replace that step after the build is versioned and parked for review. Leaving both paths alive leaves a bypass.
