./docs/sol/sol_out_v2.txt:18:Neill is building a voice-first system that dispatches AI coding agents to build software for him. He talks to it while driving. The original plan was to build on OPENCLAW — a popular open-source agent platform (very widely used; provides a persistent daemon, multi-provider model routing, parallel non-blocking agent spawning, session management, agent memory, a plugin ecosystem, a web UI, and Tailscale/launchd integration).
