A major end-to-end gap is now confirmed by both the live call graph and the branch’s own handoff: the new merge gate has no caller, so reviewed work cannot advance to the shipped state. I’m continuing to test adjacent paths—especially whether the “separate service” is actually used for spending and whether the new database structures are installed on existing records—before assigning severity.
