    56	
    57	1. **A job with no requirements had no requirements to fail.** Both completion guards
    58	   only fired when the requirement counts were above zero, and they default to zero. A
    59	   job created outside dispatch went straight to done with no reviews at all.
    60	2. **The builder's own family counted toward "different minds."** A GPT seat could build
    61	   it, a GPT seat could pass it, and that counted as one of the two required families.
    62	   Same-family review is still *allowed* (deliberate earlier decision, and banning it
    63	   outright would deadlock a Claude-built job) — it just no longer counts toward
    64	   diversity.
